<urn:atm:triage:finding/QA-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "QA-001" ;
  triage:title "New tests don't cover the non-socket-file, uid-mismatch, or identity-changed-during-race rejection branches" ;
  triage:description "The two new tests (dead_owner_socket_is_reclaimed_before_rebinding, reachable_socket_is_never_replaced) only cover the 'clean dead socket, same uid' and 'live socket' paths. The non-socket-file-at-path rejection (line 87), uid-mismatch-on-stale-socket rejection (line 95), and identity-changed-during-race rejection (line 115) — exactly the narrow safety branches this fix relies on — have no regression test. Recommend adding at least one test for the uid-mismatch or non-socket-file rejection path." ;
